  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760345,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1st Demo: A Taste of Football Management on the Commodore 64\n\nStep onto the virtual pitch with *1st Demo*, a thrilling introduction to football management brought to life on the Commodore 64! This demo offers a tantalizing glimpse into the full *1st Division Manager* game, letting you experience the highs and lows of leading a team to glory.\n\nChoose your club from the top four English leagues and immediately immerse yourself in the strategic world of football. Manage your players, make crucial tactical decisions, and guide your team to victory. Following each match, receive detailed reports on player injuries, vital results from rival games, and a breakdown of your club's finances – essential for long-term success.\n\n*1st Demo* showcases the core gameplay loop of *1st Division Manager*, providing a taste of the depth and challenge that awaits. Experience the excitement of matchday, the pressure of managing a squad, and the satisfaction of building a winning team, all within the limitations and charm of the Commodore 64. It's a brief but compelling preview of a promising football management experience!"
    },
